+// HITheme came with Mac OS X 10.3. The 10.2 HIToolbox already exports some of
+// it, but HIThemeGetButtonBackgroundBounds, for one, answers an empty
+// rectangle there. Before 10.3 the bounds come from the Appearance Manager,
+// which takes the same button description with QuickDraw rectangles.
+static bool qt_jaguar_hasHITheme()
+{
+    return &HIThemeGetButtonShape != 0;
+}
