+/****************************************************************************
+**
+** Mac OS X 10.2 (Jaguar) support for the Carbon port of QtGui.
+**
+** Qt 4.8 calls Carbon, CoreGraphics, ImageIO, Pasteboard and UTI functions
+** that Mac OS X 10.3 or 10.4 introduced. Built with a 10.2 deployment target
+** against the 10.4 headers, those are weak imports: NULL on 10.2. Each one
+** used by QtGui is wrapped here by a qt_jaguar_ function that calls the real
+** function when it exists and otherwise does the 10.2 equivalent, or fails
+** the way the API reports failure. The macros below route Qt's calls to the
+** wrappers, so no call site changes and nothing changes on 10.3 and later.
+**
+****************************************************************************/
